  data: {
    LLM: "1. Check for four of a kind (instant win). 2. Form up to 5 combinations: trips > straight flush > straight > flush > unrelated. 3. Discard at least 2. 4. Player to dealer's right leads; anticlockwise. 5. Each plays highest combo; highest wins round. 6. Round 1 = 1 chip, round 2 = 2 chips, etc. 7. Winner of round leads next. 8. Players with no combos sit out.",
    Player: "1. Check for four of a kind (instant win). 2. Form up to 5 combinations: trips > straight flush > straight > flush > unrelated. 3. Discard at least 2. 4. Player to dealer's right leads; anticlockwise. 5. Each plays highest combo; highest wins round. 6. Round 1 = 1 chip, round 2 = 2 chips, etc. 7. Winner of round leads next. 8. Players with no combos sit out.",
    objective: 'Win the most chips. Form 3-card combinations; win rounds; round N pays N chips.',
